{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29110","headline":"送卢先辈自衡岳赴复州嘉礼二首 一 · 许浑","name":"送卢先辈自衡岳赴复州嘉礼二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名振金闺步玉京，暂留沧海见高情。\n衆花尽处松千尺，羣鸟喧时鹤一声。\n朱阁簟凉疎雨过，碧溪船动早潮生。\n离心不异西江水，直送征帆万里行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}